  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda COVID-19 Emergency  Education Response Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to support student learning in pre-primary, primary and lower secondary during school closures associated with the COVID-19 pandemic and ensure a safe reopening and student reentry.</narrative>
